WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.700
=Episode 10=

01:47.860 --> 01:50.259
(Yujie Hub)

01:50.800 --> 01:53.620
(Hundred-Foot Spring Platform)

01:58.880 --> 01:59.800
I am finally home.

02:27.960 --> 02:28.480
What?

02:29.400 --> 02:30.880
Do you know why you were punished?

02:31.400 --> 02:32.320
Copy the book.

02:33.800 --> 02:35.640
He bullied Luohuan.

02:36.880 --> 02:38.240
Because you got mad,

02:38.560 --> 02:40.280
so you beat him so hard?

02:40.680 --> 02:41.600
No.

02:42.079 --> 02:44.040
If I'd known that cliff is unstable,

02:44.360 --> 02:46.000
of course I wouldn't
have beat him that hard.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.440
If you'd known?

02:48.200 --> 02:49.840
You'd never know everything.

02:54.040 --> 02:54.960
Some things

02:56.000 --> 02:58.640
are better not knowing.

03:00.000 --> 03:00.760
I don't understand.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.960
You're always hiding things
from me anyway.

03:04.720 --> 03:05.520
So Qingfei,

03:05.920 --> 03:08.280
what is the relationship
between Yue Jinzhao and Luohuan?

03:09.000 --> 03:10.640
Why do they look exactly alike?

03:13.200 --> 03:14.400
What's your progress?

03:15.920 --> 03:16.480
The beginning.

03:16.600 --> 03:17.560
Then you better hurry up.

03:18.040 --> 03:19.320
You're not eating until you finish.

03:19.880 --> 03:20.960
What?

03:20.960 --> 03:21.680
What what?

03:22.200 --> 03:23.200
I didn't say that.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.680
The eldest brother said it.

03:41.120 --> 03:41.520
Brother.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.040
I'm back.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.760
How are Qi and Yue Jinzhao doing?

03:51.200 --> 03:51.920
Brother.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.680
I've been away for so long,

03:54.200 --> 03:55.400
and all you talk about is Jinzhao.

03:55.760 --> 03:56.760
You don't even care about me.

04:01.200 --> 04:01.920
Take a seat properly.

04:06.400 --> 04:08.080
Seeing you so carefree,

04:08.520 --> 04:09.280
I knew

04:10.480 --> 04:11.560
they are fine.

04:12.240 --> 04:14.640
Yes, they are out of danger now

04:14.960 --> 04:16.320
and taken away by those of Mount Yuqing.

04:20.720 --> 04:21.399
Alright.

04:22.640 --> 04:23.520
Over these three years,

04:23.760 --> 04:25.440
the progress of Qi
and Jinzhao's Resonance Spell

04:26.000 --> 04:27.680
has been slow.

04:28.280 --> 04:29.040
But this time,

04:30.120 --> 04:31.640
they've increased
dramatically in strength.

04:32.640 --> 04:34.400
I can't believe
they could kill the Zhenyao fish.

04:37.159 --> 04:38.280
It's because of the Qiyuan Orb.

04:40.120 --> 04:41.159
Previously in the Fujin Hall,

04:41.920 --> 04:43.159
Qi accidentally ate many Qiyuan Orbs.

04:44.280 --> 04:46.280
The Qiyuan Orb contains
the power of human life force.

04:47.080 --> 04:47.560
So,

04:48.440 --> 04:50.480
it could be the key for Qi
obtaining her power this time.

04:51.720 --> 04:54.240
And Qi has also grown scales.

04:56.240 --> 04:57.960
Has her mythical beast power awakened?

04:58.720 --> 04:59.080
Yes.

05:02.920 --> 05:03.360
Brother.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.720
Did you take the medicine I gave you?

05:09.000 --> 05:10.040
Your analysis

05:11.880 --> 05:12.640
makes sense.

05:14.600 --> 05:16.840
It is just that the Qiyuan Orb

05:16.920 --> 05:18.720
contains all kinds of dark emotions

05:19.480 --> 05:20.920
before dying.

05:24.520 --> 05:27.200
Has Qi's temper changed
after absorbing the Qiyuan Orbs?

05:28.760 --> 05:29.720
Nothing changed.

05:29.920 --> 05:30.800
She can eat and drink,

05:31.560 --> 05:32.960
and is as happy as always.

05:35.440 --> 05:38.400
After absorbing the Qiyuan Orbs,
Qi's strength has greatly increased

05:39.720 --> 05:42.000
and her sanity hasn't been affected.

05:45.000 --> 05:47.120
This is beneficial for us.

05:48.000 --> 05:48.400
Right.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.080
This is Rehai Water

05:53.640 --> 05:55.320
that Luo Maiming gave us
for contacting him.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.880
What did Luo Maiming say?

05:57.960 --> 05:59.360
He did bind Rehai with blood,

06:00.480 --> 06:03.440
but also intends
to undo the Bloodbinding.

06:06.840 --> 06:07.280
No rush.

06:08.560 --> 06:10.160
As soon as we're done with Qiyuan Sect,

06:10.520 --> 06:12.800
I will personally meet him.

06:13.680 --> 06:13.960
Okay.

06:16.080 --> 06:17.000
So everything's all right.

06:17.320 --> 06:18.450
I'll go check on Xiaoyuan.

06:18.800 --> 06:19.040
OK.

06:20.000 --> 06:20.320
Wait.

06:23.080 --> 06:25.120
She's currently being punished
by copying scriptures.

06:25.640 --> 06:28.080
Don't copy for her.

06:30.120 --> 06:30.880
I won't.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.480
She's getting headstrong.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.800
It's all because you spoil her.

06:38.560 --> 06:40.760
Not just me, so is Qingfei.

06:41.520 --> 06:41.960
Get lost.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.040
I'll get out.

06:47.120 --> 06:47.560
Brother.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.360
You really need
to take care of yourself.

06:52.000 --> 06:54.560
Otherwise, we four

06:54.960 --> 06:55.880
will be one short.

07:12.240 --> 07:14.770
(Mount Yuqing)

07:29.040 --> 07:31.320
Jinzhao, I don't want to lose...

07:32.520 --> 07:33.520
I don't want to lose...

07:35.240 --> 07:36.640
What don't you want to lose?

07:39.040 --> 07:39.600
Jinzhao.

07:45.880 --> 07:46.600
You've hit my wound.

07:47.920 --> 07:48.680
It hurts.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.240
Really? Let me see.

08:16.880 --> 08:17.360
Qi.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.920
Do you remember anything unusual

08:20.520 --> 08:21.600
about you when you saved me?

08:23.080 --> 08:23.640
Unusual?

08:25.200 --> 08:26.040
What kind of unusual?

08:31.000 --> 08:31.840
I must've seen it wrong.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.679
Where is this?

08:37.520 --> 08:38.400
Mount Yuqing.

08:38.520 --> 08:39.720
It's Ming Xiu and Mr. Gu

08:39.720 --> 08:41.440
who picked us up from the cliff.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.800
Senior Xian Qing, Mr. Gu.

08:53.200 --> 08:55.080
Mr. Gu, thank you for saving my life.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.240
The first thing

08:57.680 --> 08:59.560
you should thank is your own efforts.

09:01.080 --> 09:01.480
Jinzhao.

09:03.280 --> 09:03.800
Jinzhao.

09:04.320 --> 09:05.600
Jinzhao, you are awake.

09:08.040 --> 09:10.040
You look much better now.

09:12.960 --> 09:15.200
Master's medicine certainly works.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.640
It's not that my medicine works.

09:18.200 --> 09:18.840
Mr. Yue.

09:19.360 --> 09:21.040
In fact, when I found you and Miss Yue,

09:21.240 --> 09:22.840
Miss Yue was almost healed,

09:23.160 --> 09:25.760
and your wound was obviously treated.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.520
And the demonic aura on you

09:29.120 --> 09:30.160
was the same as that

09:30.280 --> 09:32.480
on Miss Shuo Xuan
we met in Luori Village.

09:32.800 --> 09:33.800
Shuo Xuan?

09:34.840 --> 09:35.880
Why did she save us?

09:37.080 --> 09:39.600
Does she have anything to do
with Bian Luohuan too?

09:41.520 --> 09:43.040
Jinzhao, don't worry.

09:43.320 --> 09:44.400
With my strength,

09:44.560 --> 09:45.320
next time I see her,

09:45.320 --> 09:46.760
I will definitely catch her and ask her.

09:53.160 --> 09:54.320
N-No, it's not me.

09:55.720 --> 09:57.560
Sorry, it's me. I'm hungry.

09:58.800 --> 10:00.400
Jinzhao, I'll go cook for you.

10:03.840 --> 10:04.360
Wait for me.

10:16.960 --> 10:17.480
Mr. Gu.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.400
Sorry for the bother.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.080
I may take my leave.

10:24.960 --> 10:25.840
Leave?

10:27.000 --> 10:28.680
Luo, do you have something to do?

10:30.240 --> 10:31.920
I just learned
Zhengwu Alliance wiped out

10:31.920 --> 10:33.480
Qiyuan Sect's stronghold in Jiangning.

10:34.080 --> 10:35.360
There might be some new clues

10:35.760 --> 10:36.920
that can help Yue.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.240
Won't you say goodbye to others?

10:45.640 --> 10:46.960
This is urgent...

10:46.960 --> 10:47.880
Then,

10:48.880 --> 10:50.000
Zhaoyan, you go ahead.

10:53.760 --> 10:54.280
Thank you.

10:56.400 --> 10:58.040
It's a long way to Jingan.

10:58.440 --> 10:59.840
Please let Xiu send you off.

11:03.160 --> 11:04.520
Then thank you, Miss Ming.

11:06.320 --> 11:06.760
Farewell.

11:23.360 --> 11:23.920
I think

11:25.760 --> 11:27.520
she's in an urgency to avoid me.

11:30.320 --> 11:33.040
There's a lot of weird and
interesting things going on today.

11:33.480 --> 11:34.040
Well,

11:35.080 --> 11:35.920
one more round?

11:40.800 --> 11:42.760
You might lose one more game.

11:43.760 --> 11:44.760
That's quite arrogant.

11:53.920 --> 11:55.560
Luohuan, you're back.

11:59.520 --> 12:00.440
Let me see.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.960
You have no improvement
in writing at all.

12:06.880 --> 12:08.280
I want to go play in the snow.

12:08.680 --> 12:09.800
I don't want to write.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.200
Do you want to play in the snow?

12:14.760 --> 12:15.280
Go ahead.

12:16.800 --> 12:19.600
But I'm not done yet.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.120
Easy-peasy.

12:22.280 --> 12:23.840
Same old rules, I will copy it for you.

12:26.680 --> 12:28.160
Qingfei, I'm going to play in the snow.

12:31.040 --> 12:31.920
Qingfei.

12:32.920 --> 12:34.200
It's best to be home.

12:35.200 --> 12:36.880
I can't even drink your wine outside.

12:40.160 --> 12:41.200
Did brother blame you?

12:43.760 --> 12:44.160
No.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.080
But...

12:48.720 --> 12:49.280
Qingfei,

12:50.000 --> 12:51.120
he had another seizure today.

12:52.280 --> 12:52.800
However,

12:53.520 --> 12:54.360
don't worry too much.

12:58.160 --> 12:59.200
He has a heavy mind

13:00.120 --> 13:01.360
and his emotions fluctuate greatly.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.560
Did you make him angry again?

13:05.880 --> 13:06.840
No way.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.880
I am still better than Xiaoyuan.

13:09.160 --> 13:10.400
Then why is he so agitated?

13:14.600 --> 13:17.080
Because the mythical beast power
of our fish

13:17.160 --> 13:18.040
has finally awakened.

13:18.440 --> 13:19.240
He's overjoyed.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.400
You're the only one

13:22.400 --> 13:23.640
who dares to do that in front of him.

13:26.840 --> 13:27.760
I think

13:28.880 --> 13:29.720
he is too tired.

13:31.000 --> 13:32.920
I hope him to be a bit relaxed

13:33.360 --> 13:33.960
and happier.

13:36.240 --> 13:38.280
(Qi has awakened her power
by absorbing the Qiyuan Orbs,)

13:39.040 --> 13:39.960
(but it must hurt too.)

13:42.040 --> 13:43.480
(She never used to cry before,)

13:44.680 --> 13:47.240
(yet, she shed tears in the Fujin Hall.)

13:49.560 --> 13:49.960
Qingfei.

13:50.880 --> 13:51.640
I'm going for a walk.

14:10.120 --> 14:10.920
Just leave like that.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.160
That's quite decisive.

14:15.040 --> 14:17.000
Do you want me to divine

14:17.200 --> 14:18.680
your future with Master Luo?

14:21.040 --> 14:21.560
No need.

14:22.840 --> 14:24.160
If we divine everything in the future,

14:25.120 --> 14:26.040
what's the point of living?

14:45.720 --> 14:46.520
Xian Qing.

14:47.120 --> 14:48.280
Speaking of the future,

14:48.520 --> 14:50.040
what are your expectations
for the future?

14:52.840 --> 14:53.840
A demon lives for a long time.

14:54.440 --> 14:56.240
I've been doing
whatever I want for a thousand years.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.080
I have nothing to expect.

14:59.240 --> 15:01.480
As a demon, you've been
doing whatever you want,

15:01.840 --> 15:04.560
so why bother to find troubles
in relationship like humans?

15:07.320 --> 15:09.240
Do you need me to give you some advice?

15:11.720 --> 15:13.240
We are all novices facing relationship.

15:14.560 --> 15:15.520
Someone

15:16.160 --> 15:18.000
can't even accept his own disciple.

15:19.680 --> 15:21.520
Don't pretend to be cool.

15:24.400 --> 15:26.120
Someone regains
his half of demonic power back,

15:26.200 --> 15:28.000
yet can't even keep
the one he cares about.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.720
How dare he said that to me!

15:46.120 --> 15:46.800
You cheated again.

15:48.640 --> 15:49.080
I quit.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.600
Someone is a cheater,

15:53.560 --> 15:55.000
yet looks gentle,

15:55.440 --> 15:56.750
confusing the people.

16:01.880 --> 16:02.720
I won again.

16:25.720 --> 16:26.600
Three years ago,

16:27.600 --> 16:30.040
the memories erased
when Qi left the Yujie Hub

16:30.960 --> 16:34.080
have become the star curtain
over the Hundred-Foot Spring Platform.

16:35.960 --> 16:36.760
I thought

16:37.360 --> 16:38.520
you would never open them again.

16:40.440 --> 16:41.120
This is different.

16:45.720 --> 16:48.240
Qingfei, look, she's so adorable.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.400
I still remember that day

16:53.120 --> 16:53.960
when Qi was just born,

16:54.720 --> 16:55.640
you and brother

16:56.120 --> 16:58.520
brought her back from
the Sea of Clear Skies to Yujie Hub.

16:58.990 --> 17:02.310
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

17:05.550 --> 17:06.609
Master.

17:07.760 --> 17:10.710
♪Who can see them clearly♪

17:12.910 --> 17:17.440
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

17:17.440 --> 17:18.160
I found

17:19.880 --> 17:21.880
you've become completely
different this time.

17:23.079 --> 17:24.359
Did something happen?

17:25.800 --> 17:27.319
I've been following them
for three years.

17:28.840 --> 17:29.840
I thought

17:32.200 --> 17:33.640
I've already accepted everything.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.040
But

17:37.200 --> 17:37.960
(in the Fujin Hall,)

17:37.960 --> 17:39.980
(when Qi cried after she
accidentally ate the Qiyuan Orbs,)

17:40.880 --> 17:42.120
(I would still feel bad.)

17:44.520 --> 17:46.960
(When she protected me subconsciously
in Luori Village,)

17:48.320 --> 17:49.600
(I would still be moved.)

17:51.600 --> 17:54.280
(Seeing her risking her life
to protect Yue Jinzhao at Yinma River,)

17:55.440 --> 17:56.560
(I would even get jealous.)

17:57.520 --> 17:58.040
Perhaps

17:59.560 --> 18:00.360
I still can't let go.

18:02.840 --> 18:03.360
Huan.

18:04.210 --> 18:06.160
You once swore to the Chastisement Stone

18:06.480 --> 18:08.760
that you would never
use the Resonance Spell on Qi,

18:09.160 --> 18:10.520
or expose your identity.

18:11.240 --> 18:11.920
Otherwise,

18:12.120 --> 18:14.240
brother won't let you go
watch over Qi and Yue Jinzhao.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.570
- You can't...
- Qingfei.

18:16.040 --> 18:16.800
I'm just kidding.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.080
Don't be nervous.

18:20.880 --> 18:21.720
You brat.

18:22.360 --> 18:24.280
Don't ever play jokes
like that on me again.

18:24.680 --> 18:25.160
Rest assured.

18:26.520 --> 18:27.640
I know what I have to do.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.760
I am still Qi's master.

18:32.160 --> 18:32.760
I will

18:34.360 --> 18:35.520
guide Qi and Yue Jinzhao

18:35.520 --> 18:36.840
to become the sharpest sword.

18:41.070 --> 18:48.460
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪

18:50.880 --> 18:52.880
Qi, are you ready?

18:53.440 --> 18:55.360
Jinzhao, just a moment.

18:55.560 --> 18:56.640
It's almost done.

18:59.960 --> 19:00.320
Qi!

19:01.880 --> 19:02.600
Jinzhao.

19:02.600 --> 19:03.000
Qi.

19:03.000 --> 19:03.840
Jinzhao.

19:03.840 --> 19:05.200
Qi, what's wrong?

19:06.960 --> 19:08.800
I just wanted
to make you a bowl of noodles.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.160
So how is it?

19:17.600 --> 19:18.520
Have a taste.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.920
It looks good.

19:27.320 --> 19:27.960
Of course.

19:28.000 --> 19:30.360
The broth is an herbal soup
that I simmered.

19:30.480 --> 19:31.480
It could dispel cold.

19:31.560 --> 19:32.360
Have a try.

19:42.600 --> 19:43.640
How's it? Is it delicious?

19:47.640 --> 19:48.240
Yes.

19:48.760 --> 19:49.680
This is the best noodles

19:50.680 --> 19:51.680
I've ever had.

19:51.920 --> 19:53.520
Really? I'll have a taste too.

19:59.920 --> 20:00.560
You're lying.

20:00.680 --> 20:01.560
I'm not.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.400
Everyone has different tastes.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.040
It's really delicious.

20:10.520 --> 20:12.840
Why do you suddenly
want to cook me noodles?

20:13.360 --> 20:14.880
I used to cook them for you before.

20:16.400 --> 20:17.760
I also want to do something.

20:19.040 --> 20:20.000
Why do you say so?

20:21.480 --> 20:22.680
When you were unconscious,

20:22.880 --> 20:23.960
Mr. Gu told me

20:24.280 --> 20:25.520
we have to grow up.

20:25.960 --> 20:27.000
We need to think about

20:27.200 --> 20:29.360
what we want to do and what we can do,

20:29.920 --> 20:31.720
and we can't always listen to others.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.770
You want to grow up that much?

20:35.240 --> 20:38.240
Yes. Only when I grow up
can I become stronger

20:38.560 --> 20:40.320
and protect those who I want to protect.

20:40.960 --> 20:43.240
You used to protect me all the time.

20:43.920 --> 20:46.880
Jinzhao, I also want to
protect you from now on.

20:50.440 --> 20:52.440
It seems our Qi has really grown up.

20:55.560 --> 20:57.600
Okay, you protect me.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.160
Alright.

21:00.320 --> 21:01.240
I cooked it wrong,

21:01.320 --> 21:02.560
and I'll make you another bowl.

21:09.720 --> 21:10.760
(If you learn to make noodles,)

21:11.800 --> 21:12.800
(then you won't need me)

21:13.600 --> 21:14.480
(to cook for you anymore.)

21:27.520 --> 21:29.520
Miss Yue can resonate with the key ring.

21:30.840 --> 21:31.960
It seems that she has

21:33.040 --> 21:34.600
a deep connection with the Nine Springs.

21:36.440 --> 21:36.840
Senior.

21:43.600 --> 21:45.480
Senior, do you know divination?

21:47.080 --> 21:49.200
Mr. Yue, do you believe in divination?

21:50.560 --> 21:51.880
Then could you please

21:52.160 --> 21:53.320
do a divination for me and Qi?

21:54.400 --> 21:56.800
I want to know more about our origins.

21:58.080 --> 21:58.600
Sure.

21:58.960 --> 22:00.920
Mr. Yue, just tell me the birthdates

22:01.080 --> 22:02.040
of you and Miss Yue.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.080
Birthdates?

22:11.400 --> 22:12.120
But senior,

22:13.320 --> 22:14.720
Qi and I have no memory of what happened

22:15.480 --> 22:16.520
three years ago,

22:16.880 --> 22:19.120
and we don't know our birthdates.

22:20.920 --> 22:21.600
Well...

22:22.360 --> 22:24.520
Do you have any memorable date
that could serve as birthdates?

22:24.800 --> 22:25.760
Maybe we could try.

22:27.000 --> 22:27.600
July 14th.

22:29.480 --> 22:30.160
July

22:31.400 --> 22:32.200
14th?

22:34.040 --> 22:34.480
What's wrong?

22:37.880 --> 22:39.120
Three years ago on this day,

22:39.280 --> 22:41.320
I once encountered
a strange event in some place.

22:42.280 --> 22:44.400
I thought it might have something
to do with you and Miss Yue,

22:44.560 --> 22:45.780
so I paid special attention.

22:46.080 --> 22:46.760
What is it?

22:47.080 --> 22:48.440
Where?

22:49.560 --> 22:52.320
This place might have something
to do with your birthdates.

22:52.680 --> 22:54.480
Would you like to go with me?

22:54.640 --> 22:56.200
Yes, of course.

22:57.040 --> 22:57.600
Thank you.

23:11.360 --> 23:12.280
Xiu, you are back.

23:12.720 --> 23:15.520
Master, are you going to take Mr. Yue
and the others to the Spring Vein?

23:17.520 --> 23:18.720
How could you let them enter

23:19.560 --> 23:20.920
such an important place?

23:22.200 --> 23:23.200
It seems

23:23.320 --> 23:25.640
you still have some sense
of guarding the hole of spring.

23:29.280 --> 23:30.920
I was just stating the fact.

23:33.880 --> 23:35.280
Mr. Yue and Miss Yue might have

23:35.560 --> 23:37.160
a deep connection with the Nine Springs.

23:37.880 --> 23:38.920
I had a divination last night.

23:40.640 --> 23:42.400
There may be some anomalies
in the Spring Vein.

23:43.480 --> 23:45.120
It'd be nice
to take some precautions in advance.

23:47.720 --> 23:49.240
Divination is just asking for trouble.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.480
Isn't it sadder to know the future

23:51.960 --> 23:53.240
yet could do nothing?

23:57.000 --> 23:58.960
The hole of Pureness
can foresee the future.

23:59.920 --> 24:01.240
Whoever holds the key ring

24:01.920 --> 24:03.320
may see a vision of the future

24:03.440 --> 24:04.520
in the hole of spring.

24:08.520 --> 24:09.600
Is that why

24:09.760 --> 24:11.920
you've been reluctant
to be the guardian of Pureness?

24:17.240 --> 24:19.480
The future may not be certain.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.080
Master, you are too optimistic.

24:24.720 --> 24:26.190
Since it has not yet happened,

24:26.510 --> 24:27.630
how could it be predestined?

24:28.120 --> 24:29.200
You should go along.

24:37.040 --> 24:37.600
Never mind.

24:38.280 --> 24:39.520
Since you don't want to go,

24:40.320 --> 24:41.440
then I won't force you.

24:46.040 --> 24:46.600
Master.

24:59.720 --> 25:01.800
Master, we've arrived.

25:07.360 --> 25:08.240
What is this?

25:09.000 --> 25:10.100
The entrance to the Pureness.

25:11.680 --> 25:13.560
This is the Pureness,
one of the Shennong Nine Springs.

25:14.600 --> 25:16.720
Mr. Yue, you know
about the Nine Springs?

25:17.680 --> 25:21.080
I-I saw a mural once.

25:21.970 --> 25:24.300
Shennong Nine Springs?

25:24.640 --> 25:26.040
What are you talking about?

25:27.720 --> 25:29.400
Mr. Ju, you'd know it if you go in.

25:30.800 --> 25:32.400
The Pureness can foresee the future.

25:32.760 --> 25:34.680
I am the guardian of Pureness.

25:35.400 --> 25:36.440
The bracelet in my hand

25:36.520 --> 25:38.160
is the key ring
that unlocks the Pureness.

25:40.880 --> 25:43.920
Mr. Gu,
were your ancestors guardians too?

25:45.840 --> 25:47.840
The key ring
is not passed down through generations,

25:48.320 --> 25:51.320
but given to the chosen successor
by the previous guardian.

25:53.480 --> 25:55.800
If the guardians fail
to give out the key rings and die,

25:56.040 --> 25:58.080
the key ring will become
like an ordinary bracelet

25:58.280 --> 26:00.000
until it meets the next destined one.

26:01.880 --> 26:05.240
Senior Gu, does the strange event
three years ago have something

26:06.440 --> 26:07.200
to do with it?

26:08.120 --> 26:08.640
Exactly.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.920
So this is
what the Nine Springs looks like.

26:25.040 --> 26:28.160
I've heard about it,
but this is my first time seeing it.

26:28.840 --> 26:30.000
Nine Springs have various shapes.

26:30.080 --> 26:31.440
And the holes of springs also vary.

26:31.960 --> 26:34.080
Everyone, come with me
into the Pureness.

26:41.360 --> 26:44.370
(Wangchen Region)

26:45.280 --> 26:46.720
Where is this?

26:47.080 --> 26:49.600
It's so quiet
that makes me feel a little nervous.

26:50.200 --> 26:52.480
This place is near the Netherworld.
Indeed it's tranquil.

26:53.240 --> 26:55.200
N-N-Netherworld?

26:57.280 --> 26:58.360
Just near it.

26:59.040 --> 27:00.400
This place is called Wangchen Region.

27:00.680 --> 27:03.220
At the end of this path
is the hole of spring Cold Marrow.

27:03.880 --> 27:06.160
Isn't the hole of spring
called Pureness?

27:07.880 --> 27:08.840
The Spring Veins are connected.

27:09.120 --> 27:10.400
Since we have the Pureness key ring,

27:10.600 --> 27:12.080
we can use it to enter the Spring Vein,

27:12.280 --> 27:13.600
and then go to other holes.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.640
But each hole has its own garrison.

27:16.280 --> 27:18.400
If we approach
without the appropriate key ring,

27:18.680 --> 27:20.040
we may be attacked by the garrison.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.040
You should be careful.

27:21.960 --> 27:23.040
You mean...

27:25.280 --> 27:26.960
When you pass through this dark place

27:26.960 --> 27:27.960
and reach the Cold Marrow,

27:28.400 --> 27:30.680
I will tell you about the event
happened three years ago.

27:31.920 --> 27:33.120
Is this a test?

27:33.800 --> 27:35.160
Alright, deal.

27:36.160 --> 27:36.480
Let's go.

27:37.880 --> 27:40.000
Mr. Gu, aren't you coming with us?

28:05.200 --> 28:08.160
You are not the guardians
of Cold Marrow, leave now.

28:09.160 --> 28:11.640
W-We came with a guardian.

28:12.160 --> 28:13.720
Without guardians,
the hole can't be opened.

28:14.240 --> 28:16.180
It is the duty
of the Nine Springs garrison.

28:18.480 --> 28:20.210
Are you the garrison of the Cold Marrow?

28:20.960 --> 28:22.560
(Wangchen Siming)
I am Wangchen Siming.

28:23.120 --> 28:25.800
Siming? Quite arrogant.

28:27.480 --> 28:28.600
Among you,

28:28.840 --> 28:30.600
two will die soon.

28:31.040 --> 28:32.960
W-What do you mean?

28:33.360 --> 28:34.320
Don't scare us.

28:34.720 --> 28:36.080
This is what the Cold Marrow indicates.

28:36.640 --> 28:37.840
Your days are counting down.

28:38.280 --> 28:39.400
Better leave now.

28:40.640 --> 28:41.520
Make yourself clear.

28:42.800 --> 28:44.680
She could be deliberately deceiving

28:44.840 --> 28:45.720
to scare us off.

28:46.160 --> 28:47.960
Don't talk nonsense. We are not scared.

28:48.520 --> 28:49.880
You'll be punished by heaven

28:50.120 --> 28:51.080
if you don't leave.

28:51.920 --> 28:53.400
You get angry when questioned.

28:54.240 --> 28:56.320
Is that a garrison
of hole of spring all about?

28:57.160 --> 28:59.640
Are you really not afraid of death?

29:01.680 --> 29:03.560
Jinzhao, maybe we should listen to her

29:03.560 --> 29:04.200
and leave now.

29:04.240 --> 29:06.360
No, we have to move forward.

29:07.400 --> 29:08.160
I'm with you.

29:09.870 --> 29:10.740
Interesting.

29:11.600 --> 29:13.280
I wonder what lies ahead.

29:41.800 --> 29:42.280
Master?

29:52.600 --> 29:53.320
Zhaoyan.

30:01.800 --> 30:02.400
Qi.

30:04.880 --> 30:05.440
Qi.

30:07.320 --> 30:07.920
Qi.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.800
Jinzhao.

30:09.800 --> 30:10.120
Qi.

30:10.120 --> 30:10.800
I am here.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.640
Jinzhao, what's wrong?

30:13.280 --> 30:13.840
Qi.

30:14.000 --> 30:14.800
Jinzhao!

30:21.840 --> 30:22.560
Senior!

30:25.840 --> 30:26.480
Ming Xiu.

30:30.800 --> 30:31.320
Shifang?

30:33.720 --> 30:34.840
What's wrong with them?

30:35.560 --> 30:37.040
Why am I the only one who's fine?

30:43.600 --> 30:44.920
What did you do to them?

31:04.880 --> 31:05.480
Qi!

31:07.640 --> 31:08.680
Bian Luohuan.

31:11.960 --> 31:12.600
Bian Luohuan.

31:12.920 --> 31:13.520
Stop.

31:18.440 --> 31:18.680
Qi?

31:19.080 --> 31:20.560
Master, take me away now.

31:21.960 --> 31:22.360
Qi.

31:23.400 --> 31:23.680
Qi.

31:24.160 --> 31:24.960
Let me go.

31:25.440 --> 31:25.920
Qi!

31:32.200 --> 31:34.440
I'm getting tired of the Mindlink.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.160
Qi!

31:40.200 --> 31:40.920
Jinzhao.

31:42.200 --> 31:43.760
Jinzhao, I am right here.

31:47.560 --> 31:48.600
Mindlink.

32:06.450 --> 32:08.240
(Jinzhao, wake up.)

32:11.280 --> 32:12.960
Jinzhao, wake up.

32:27.560 --> 32:29.440
(Jinzhao!)

32:31.360 --> 32:32.160
(Wake up.)

32:43.800 --> 32:44.690
You can't go with him.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.160
You can't go with him.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.270
I'm not going anywhere.

32:48.480 --> 32:50.880
Jinzhao, it seems
everyone is trapped by spell.

32:51.120 --> 32:52.120
Let's help them.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.280
Miss Shuo Xuan.

33:08.840 --> 33:09.600
Miss Shuo Xuan.

33:11.600 --> 33:13.840
Miss Shuo Xuan, I am sorry.

33:14.880 --> 33:16.720
I didn't mean to see you bathing

33:16.960 --> 33:17.800
that time.

33:26.760 --> 33:30.360
E-Ever since Luori Village,

33:31.560 --> 33:32.200
I've...

33:34.920 --> 33:36.360
I've been wanting

33:38.640 --> 33:39.880
to see you again.

33:39.880 --> 33:41.100
You coward!

33:42.060 --> 33:44.260
Miss Shuo Xuan, I am not a coward.

33:44.760 --> 33:46.640
I've told you, if you come
within ten steps of me

33:46.840 --> 33:48.520
and I'd tear you apart.

33:48.680 --> 33:49.480
Miss Shuo Xuan.

33:49.680 --> 33:51.200
Miss Shuo Xuan, let go of me.

33:57.390 --> 33:58.580
Master, don't!

33:59.020 --> 34:00.750
Don't cut down that Bodhi tree!

34:18.880 --> 34:19.800
Your eyes.

34:23.540 --> 34:24.530
Zhaoyan.

34:43.360 --> 34:44.000
Zhaoyan.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.440
Why do you have to do so?

34:52.120 --> 34:52.960
We clear our debt.

34:53.480 --> 34:55.639
From now on, we don't owe each other

34:56.040 --> 34:56.920
anything.

35:04.020 --> 35:04.560
Master.

35:05.200 --> 35:06.400
Let go of me. Let...

35:08.160 --> 35:08.640
Shifang.

35:09.440 --> 35:10.440
Miss Ming Xiu.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.200
Let go of me.

35:11.200 --> 35:11.760
Shifang.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.120
Miss Shuo Xuan.

35:13.640 --> 35:14.360
Let go of me.

35:14.480 --> 35:14.880
Senior.

35:15.120 --> 35:15.800
Let go of me.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.920
Qi, no.

35:17.320 --> 35:19.240
We have to find a way
to get them out of there.

35:20.120 --> 35:21.320
I've already tried.

35:21.960 --> 35:22.880
Let go of me.

35:22.880 --> 35:24.200
Try using Mindlink.

35:29.840 --> 35:30.520
Let go of me.

35:32.600 --> 35:33.440
Let go of me.

35:53.120 --> 35:54.880
Senior.

35:56.040 --> 35:58.200
Miss Ming Xiu.

36:12.840 --> 36:16.040
This isn't some new illusion, right?

36:17.760 --> 36:19.570
Congratulations on
breaking through your inner demons.

36:21.760 --> 36:23.240
What I am about to tell you

36:23.360 --> 36:24.800
is related to this Cold Marrow.

36:26.120 --> 36:28.400
Among Nine Springs,
the Pureness can foresee the future,

36:28.640 --> 36:31.200
while the Cold Marrow can tell
life and death in the world.

36:31.640 --> 36:33.240
Life and death?

36:33.880 --> 36:36.960
Is it similar to Book of Life and Death
from the Netherworld?

36:37.280 --> 36:39.720
That's just a projection
of the Cold Marrow in the Netherworld.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.160
Three years ago, I sensed

36:41.160 --> 36:43.400
someone coming in and out
of the Pureness through the key ring.

36:44.080 --> 36:45.760
Surprised, I hurried
to the hole of spring

36:46.120 --> 36:47.960
only to find a turmoil
in the Spiritual Vein.

36:48.320 --> 36:49.280
Following the turmoil,

36:49.720 --> 36:50.800
I traced down here.

36:51.920 --> 36:54.520
This lotus tree
is the hole of spring Cold Marrow.

36:56.040 --> 36:57.000
On the Cold Marrow,

36:57.320 --> 36:59.240
each Lotus corresponds to a life.

36:59.840 --> 37:01.960
Flowers bloom and wither all the time,

37:02.280 --> 37:04.760
just like life is born and fades away.

37:05.760 --> 37:08.400
Each lotus corresponds
to the fate of each person.

37:08.960 --> 37:10.000
This is the secret of Heaven,

37:10.360 --> 37:11.840
not something
the mortals could see through.

37:12.680 --> 37:13.400
It's really you.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.640
I came here three years ago.

37:15.840 --> 37:17.880
This twin lotus resonated
with the Pureness key ring,

37:18.080 --> 37:19.080
appeared in front of me

37:19.560 --> 37:20.480
and bloomed.

37:20.760 --> 37:22.880
The fate of you two is connected.

37:24.960 --> 37:28.160
The ordinary lotus should
grow from bud to bloom,

37:28.160 --> 37:29.000
and then fade away.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.680
Just like the life of a mortal.

37:31.320 --> 37:33.760
Yet this twin lotus
appeared out of nowhere.

37:34.240 --> 37:35.680
I can't tell its origin.

37:36.080 --> 37:37.400
Mr. Yue, Miss Yue.

37:37.840 --> 37:40.000
You two might have
a deep connection with the Nine Springs.

37:41.960 --> 37:43.200
Mr. Gu, why is that?

37:43.920 --> 37:45.640
Miss Yue, please give me your hand.

37:51.200 --> 37:52.200
The key ring is glowing.

37:53.240 --> 37:54.560
The key ring I hold

37:54.560 --> 37:56.040
resonates with you.

37:56.240 --> 37:58.280
So you have a deep connection
with the spiritual vein.

37:58.960 --> 38:01.080
And the fate of you and Mr. Yue

38:01.240 --> 38:02.160
is closely connected.

38:03.400 --> 38:05.140
The spiritual vein's been unstable
in recent years.

38:05.280 --> 38:07.040
There might be some unforeseen events

38:07.320 --> 38:08.520
that would involve you.

38:09.560 --> 38:10.880
Mr. Yue, Miss Yue.

38:11.240 --> 38:12.600
No matter what happens in the future,

38:12.840 --> 38:14.680
I hope you remain cautious and fearless,

38:14.960 --> 38:16.000
and never give up.

38:18.000 --> 38:19.040
Never give up?

38:21.040 --> 38:23.200
What do you mean?

38:24.240 --> 38:25.120
You just said,

38:26.880 --> 38:29.040
the Pureness could tell the future.

38:30.240 --> 38:31.360
Do you know something?

38:32.400 --> 38:34.760
Will we have a disaster in the future?

38:37.120 --> 38:37.960
Besides,

38:38.520 --> 38:39.520
you just said,

38:39.920 --> 38:41.240
two of us

38:41.440 --> 38:43.320
will die soon.

38:43.760 --> 38:45.200
You were just lying, right?

38:45.920 --> 38:48.120
This is what the Cold Marrow indicates.

38:51.080 --> 38:53.680
T-Then who are they?

38:54.320 --> 38:55.720
The ones fated to die, of course.

38:56.640 --> 38:57.920
Lady!

39:05.680 --> 39:06.540
In my view,

39:06.880 --> 39:08.240
decades are but a moment.

39:09.120 --> 39:11.160
The garrison
has existed for millions of years.

39:12.520 --> 39:13.720
She could be

39:14.120 --> 39:15.560
talking about years away.

39:16.480 --> 39:18.720
That's true.

39:20.240 --> 39:21.870
Alright, let's head back.

39:25.200 --> 39:25.780
Let's go.

39:55.940 --> 39:59.050
♪Looking back♪

39:59.940 --> 40:02.790
♪I try to bring back memories♪

40:03.810 --> 40:07.810
♪We're connected♪

40:08.040 --> 40:10.150
♪It's meant to be♪

40:11.840 --> 40:14.990
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

40:16.070 --> 40:19.040
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

40:19.780 --> 40:21.960
♪On a moonlight night♪

40:21.960 --> 40:23.780
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

40:24.040 --> 40:26.180
♪About you♪

40:26.720 --> 40:29.960
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

40:30.720 --> 40:34.040
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

40:34.690 --> 40:36.550
♪The past glided before my mind♪

40:36.550 --> 40:38.790
♪I smiled and cried♪

40:38.790 --> 40:43.520
♪For happiness♪

40:44.040 --> 40:47.750
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:48.040 --> 40:51.970
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:51.970 --> 40:53.990
♪In this tranquil world♪

40:53.990 --> 40:55.970
♪I've finally found you♪

40:55.970 --> 41:00.070
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

41:00.070 --> 41:03.840
♪I've been looking for you♪

41:03.840 --> 41:08.100
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

41:08.840 --> 41:10.340
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

41:10.340 --> 41:12.550
♪I engrave your name♪

41:12.550 --> 41:18.880
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

41:34.020 --> 41:37.010
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

41:38.050 --> 41:40.990
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

41:42.020 --> 41:45.890
♪Both of us get closer♪

41:45.890 --> 41:48.040
♪And watch the stars♪

41:49.830 --> 41:52.950
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

41:54.020 --> 41:57.060
♪Stories leave no trace behind♪

41:57.800 --> 41:59.780
♪On a moonlight night♪

42:00.000 --> 42:01.920
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

42:01.920 --> 42:04.810
♪About you♪

42:04.810 --> 42:08.210
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

42:08.740 --> 42:10.310
♪It's unforgettable♪

42:10.310 --> 42:12.100
♪It's all about you♪

42:12.870 --> 42:14.340
♪The past glided before my mind♪

42:14.340 --> 42:16.740
♪I smiled and cried♪

42:16.740 --> 42:21.520
♪For happiness♪

42:22.310 --> 42:25.800
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

42:25.990 --> 42:30.040
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

42:30.040 --> 42:31.970
♪In this tranquil world♪

42:31.970 --> 42:33.990
♪I've finally found you♪

42:33.990 --> 42:38.120
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

42:38.120 --> 42:42.020
♪I've been looking for you♪

42:42.020 --> 42:46.240
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

42:46.820 --> 42:48.520
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

42:48.520 --> 42:50.530
♪I engrave your name♪

42:50.530 --> 42:56.860
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪
